Vasiṣṭha calms angry Rāma and explains Jābāli motive --- Vasiṣṭha tells waters, Brahmā, boar lifting earth --- Vasiṣṭha traces Brahmā through Marīci and Kaśyapa to Manu --- Manu grants prosperous earth to Ikṣvāku first Ayōdhyā king --- Vasiṣṭha lists descendants to Triśaṅku reaching heaven bodily --- Vasiṣṭha tells Asita exile and Sagara poison birth --- Vasiṣṭha names Sagara ocean digging and Aṃśumān to Bhagīratha line --- Vasiṣṭha continues through Kakutstha and Raghu to Daśaratha --- Vasiṣṭha hails Rāma eldest heir by custom and bids rule earth
